        "marks": 3,
        "stem": "In a juice factory, juice flows through a horizontal pipe with varying velocities at two ends. At point 1, the velocity of the juice is 3 m/s and the pressure is 120000 Pa. At point 2, the velocity of the juice is 7 m/s. Find the pressure at point 2.\n(Note: Assume the density of the juice is 1050 kg/m³.)",
