      },
      {
        "number": 6,
        "page": 3,
        "marks": 2,
        "stem": "The acceleration of a body vibrating on a smooth surface under elastic restoring force does not remain\nconstant during its motion.\nExplain your answer in terms of SHM and write the relevant mathematical expression.",
