      },
      {
        "number": 8,
        "page": 5,
        "marks": 3,
        "stem": "In Young’s double slit experiment, the distance between two consecutive fringes (y) is affected by the\nseparation between the slits (d).\nExplain the given statement with the help of mathematical formula.",
