      },
      {
        "number": 9,
        "page": 6,
        "marks": 7,
        "stem": "EITHER\na.\nA marathon runner weighing 60 kg runs up the stairs to the top of 440 m tall building. If he lifts\nhimself to the top in 15 minutes, then what will be his average output power?\nOR\nb.\nThe escape velocity from the Earth is about 11.2 km/s. Calculate the escape velocity from the\nSaturn whose mass is about 100 times the Earth’s mass and radius is about 10 times the Earth’s\nradius.",
        "choices": {},
        "facsimile": "/paper-crops/PHY-XI-2025-P2/q9.png",
